        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-10T20:59:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>A strict reading of the card wording could also suggest it is intented to be a <em>singular</em> villain target dealing the damage, which would exclude the possibility of multiple targets eventually becoming the source after the effect has already started resolving. I'd say I'm reading the wording just as \"strictly\" as you but still coming to a different conclusion.&nbsp;</p><p>Its gonna need official input. I would not be surprised if Christopher ruled either way. Both sides are equally valid imo atm, regardless of what I think it should be.</p>",
