        "created_at": "2014-02-10T21:19:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I can't help but think that if they were going for that, they would of worded it more like this;</p><blockquote><p>Select the Villain target with the lowest HP.</p><p>That target deals all hero targets X damage.</p></blockquote>",
