        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-11T02:24:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I don't think the damage will continue.</p><p>If a villain card dealt the lowest HP target 3 melee and 3 infernal damage and the lowest HP target dies from the melee damage, does the next in line take the infernal damage?</p><p>Wouldn't that be the same as if Apostate targetted the Highest HP hero target for 3 melee and 3 infernal, but after the melee damage was dealt that target was no longer the higest HP target?</p><p>The attack doesn't reconfigure mid-attack.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But we'll need an official ruling on this one.</p>",
